{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984005834213577110","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-30T21:13:46.000Z","kind":"original","text":"$AMZN now pulls in over $65B a year from advertising.\n\n$GOOGL monetizes search and $META monetizes attention but both are upstream.\n\nAmazon monetizes intent at the point of conversion, the layer AI agents will optimize most aggressively.","text_source":"text","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984005834213577110","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":["AMZN","GOOGL","META"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1984005573952647168","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4iajsvXsAAsKV6.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1200,"height":850,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984005834213577110"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":791,"reposts":94,"replies":32,"quotes":6,"views":94133,"bookmarks":80,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984010126546891144","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-30T21:30:49.000Z","kind":"original","text":"$AMZN expects to double capacity by 2027.\n\nThat’s a straight read-through for $NBIS, $IREN, $CIFR, $GLXY & $CRWV since these are the true AI utilities selling GPU power by the hour.","text_source":"text","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984010126546891144","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":["AMZN","NBIS","IREN","CIFR","GLXY","CRWV"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984010126546891144"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1577,"reposts":171,"replies":61,"quotes":7,"views":176093,"bookmarks":435,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984191174052106393","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-31T09:30:15.000Z","kind":"original","text":"$NVDA will supply over 260K AI chips to Samsung, Hyundai & SK Group under a South Korean government-backed deal.\n\nSamsung will build an AI facility and supply HBM4 memory, Hyundai will deploy Blackwell for manufacturing and autonomy & SK will launch an AI cloud for industrial use.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984191174052106393","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":["NVDA"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1984191167915761664","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4lDWsIWIAAF-7v.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1438,"height":840,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984191174052106393"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":2129,"reposts":287,"replies":61,"quotes":17,"views":135635,"bookmarks":170,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984195766110363842","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-31T09:48:29.000Z","kind":"original","text":"During the dotcom bubble, 97% of America’s fiber was dark because infrastructure was built years ahead of demand.\n\nToday’s AI buildout looks nothing like that. The comment “there are no dark GPUs” means every GPU produced is already reserved or monetized the moment it ships.\n\nThis is the difference between speculative infrastructure & fully utilized infrastructure.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984195766110363842","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"13_1984195624674234368","type":"video","url":"","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/1984195624674234368/img/j7SjUdhXopcK4XND.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984195766110363842"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":2218,"reposts":209,"replies":223,"quotes":44,"views":545340,"bookmarks":703,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984200229474988098","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-31T10:06:14.000Z","kind":"original","text":"$NVDA Jensen Huang said Samsung manufactures all of Nvidia’s robot processors as the two build an AI Megafactory powered by 50K GPUs.\n\nSamsung will use Blackwell & Jetson Thor to push factory robotics & extend digital twin tech across its chip, smartphone & appliance production.","text_source":"text","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984200229474988098","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":["NVDA"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1984200220343685120","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4lLlnDWUAAN0Ma.png","preview_url":"","width":1280,"height":680,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984200229474988098"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":973,"reposts":76,"replies":31,"quotes":5,"views":60365,"bookmarks":52,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1984231165868625956","user_id":"1096436452576047104","handle":"stocksavvyshay","created_at":"2025-10-31T12:09:09.000Z","kind":"original","text":"$NVDA JENSEN HUANG JUST SPOKE OK CHINA & AI OUTLOOK\n\nOn China, he’s acknowledging the geopolitical ceiling that now exists for Nvidia with Blackwell series likely facing export restrictions. But his point that China already produces its own AI chips is a pretty big deal because it’s no longer a market that can be frozen out indefinitely. Demand for compute there will be met one way or another and Nvidia’s moat comes from software & not just silicon.\n\nOn the AI outlook, the takeaway is much much larger when Jensen says we’re at the start of a ten-year buildout of a new computing platform which leads me to believe he’s talking about an architectural transition on par with the internet or mobile. AI is now commercially viable, workloads are scaling & infra spend is compounding.\n\nI agree with Jensen’s take that geopolitical friction may limit where Nvidia sells chips but it won’t slow the demand curve for AI compute globally.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1984231165868625956","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":["NVDA"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1984229272358408192","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4lmAqPa0AAr_Td.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1070,"height":714,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1984231165868625956"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":423,"reposts":42,"replies":39,"quotes":4,"views":63825,"bookmarks":33,"observed_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-23T17:05:39.107Z"}
